{
  "buildCommand": null,
  "outputDirectory": ".",
  "cleanUrls": true
}
```

Then in your project, you should have:
```
your-project/
├── index.html
├── package.json
├── vercel.json
└── (remove main.js - not needed for web)
```

## **Option 2: Separate Web and Desktop Versions**

If you want BOTH web and desktop versions, create two folders:
```
music-player/
├── web/
│   ├── index.html
│   ├── package.json
│   └── vercel.json
└── desktop/
    ├── index.html
    ├── main.js
    └── package.json (with electron)
